    },
    "upstream": "gasolina-audit 213cd500 packages/static-config/src/index.ts:191-195 returns EndpointV2 id % 30000 for every chain ('By convention the vid is alwayd the endpointV2 chainId modulo 30000'), i.e. 10425 for doma, 10287 for lineasep and 10305 for zksyncsep. Every row below disagrees with that and equals the EndpointV1 id (10423, 10286, 10248).",
    "notVerified": "scroll: see `unverified`; it keeps the EndpointV1 id 10214 as a corrected input without on-chain confirmation.",
    "howToRegenerate": "POST eth_chainId then eth_call {to: <dvn>, data: 0xcf34c768} to each rpc; no key needed."
  },
